comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T07:41:45.606Z",codex-agent,Implemented SDK atomic mutations with match preconditions on the registered evidence_state envelope. Initial writes fence updated_at because the pinned SDK rejects absent match values. Concurrent distinct and repeated review observations passed on real no-git trackers; original citations remain intact when re-anchored. SDK schema fields need their generated evidenceState option inside transactions; field assignments require an active extension registration.
  "2026-10-23T07:47:55.976Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral guard revert proof: removed only the match precondition inside Store.commit. The stale SDK item mutation regression failed 1 test because the update overwrote evidence instead of refusing. Restored source byte-for-byte. Positive tests preserve original citation digests and deduplicate repeated observations across concurrent reviewers. test/revert.acceptance.ts reproduces all three negative controls."
  "2026-10-23T08:00:00.698Z",codex-agent,"Re-anchoring now follows the uniquely resolved current fragment after movement; it never reuses stale line offsets implicitly. A single coherent source snapshot supplies the replacement descriptor and digest. Ambiguous originals refuse unless the caller explicitly supplies a unique replacement selector. Regression tests cover moved fragments, explicit replacement, preserved retained originals and JSON pointer re-anchoring."
  "2026-10-23T09:00:22.854Z",codex-agent,Heading-context preservation also survives explicit re-anchoring and repeated re-anchoring when the replacement locator is a line range. Supplemental function-only revert proof restored only reanchor from b6ef9b5; the heading ancestry regression failed 1 intended test because inherited section scope was lost. Restored fixed source byte-for-byte; all 9 focused regressions passed. This prevents review mutations from weakening the passage-identity fix.
  "2026-10-23T15:20:42.439Z",codex-agent,"DELIVERED: merged PR #1 (210cc3a319d3f61b4bad69fecbcb741dac61aa7b) is an ancestor of audited main 1bb9e2bfebdde13041e75f5fa9889a97ed577052. Inspected on main: test/process.test.ts, test/evidence.test.ts, src/store.ts. Expected-state SDK mutation, independent no-git reviewer processes, distinct observations, retry deduplication, explicit stale revision refusal and retained original citation/re-anchoring are covered. This tracker audit inspected existing tests/files; it does not claim a new full product test run."
